# Cockpit: socket activated, bound to 127.0.0.1 only until the user allows the
# local network (Settings → Remote, or `refurb-cockpit on` in a terminal).
cockpit
cockpit-ws
cockpit-bridge
cockpit-system
# The Network page. Earlier rounds claimed working network configuration, but
# this package was never installed, so Cockpit had no Network page at all.
cockpit-networkmanager
# The Disks page. Needs udisks2 (already in the desktop list) and python3-dbus.
cockpit-storaged
